  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy efficient and climate-friendly cooling solutions &amp; NDC update in Senegal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to help the country leapfrog to superior cooling solutions by enhancing stakeholder capacity for pursuing strategic priorities and an implementation framework for MEPS and labels for air conditioners and refrigerating appliances, and creating greater knowledge sharing and learning for industries and consumers on purchasing efficient cooling products.</narrative>
  </description>
